OL,3,GNEWSAHow can musicians get on stage at
OL,4,Aa festival?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs the festival season comes to an end,
OL,7,Fbudding musicians may be wondering "how
OL,8,Fcan I get on stage?".
OL,10,FWell the answers would be, do your
OL,11,Fhomework, make connections and be
OL,12,Finvolved in the "community".
OL,14,FThat's the advice industry
OL,15,Fprofessionals such as bookers, agents
OL,16,Fand festival bosses have been handing
OL,17,Fout at a music conference in Belfast on
OL,18,FThursday.
OL,20,FRoss Parkhill, from the Stendhal
OL,21,FFestival, said those things are
OL,22,F"vital".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
